; ACCEPTED (serial variant): the pen by M3/M5
; and by the Z word.
; Z <= 0 = pen down, Z > 0 = pen up under G90;
; under G91 the sign
; of the move decides, Z0 changes nothing. THE
; Z THRESHOLD IS A
; PROJECT CONVENTION, STILL OPEN (P7): check it
; on a real generator.
; Watch the servo, not the paper (the head
; draws a short line).
M5
G90 G0 X0 Y0
G21 G17 G54 G94
M3
G1 X10
M5
G0 X0
; Z words: down, up
G1 Z0
G1 X10
G0 Z5
G0 X0
G1 Z-1 F100
G1 X10
G0 Z2
G0 X0
; a Z-only line, and G0 with Z
G0 Z-0.5
G0 Z0.5
; relative: the sign of the move
G91
G1 Z-2
G1 Z3
G1 Z0
G90
; a Z with a move on the same line: the pen
; first
G1 Z-1 X10 F100
G1 Z3 X0
; Candle's Z buttons send $J= with Z: see
; README, console
M5
G90 G0 X0 Y0
M30
